'Passenger Vehicles' means Passenger Cars or Utility Vehicles;

•

'Ratio of Net Debt to Shareholders' Equity' is a non-IFRS measure calculated as (total debt less cash and cash equivalents and mutual fund current portion) divided by equity (including non-controlling interest);

•

'Revenue' means the total revenue net of excise duty unless stated otherwise;

