•

The gain on change in the fair value of commodity derivatives was Rs.13,821 million in Fiscal 2021, compared to Loss of Rs.6,882 million in Fiscal 2020, mainly at Jaguar Land Rover.

•

MTM gain on investments fair valued through profit or loss of Rs.199 million in Fiscal 2021, compared to a loss of Rs.3,891 million in Fiscal 2020. Loss in Fiscal 2020 was primarily driven by fair value reduction of Lyft investment at Jaguar Land Rover.

•

Miscellaneous income decreased by 7.0% to Rs.13,916 million in Fiscal 2021, from Rs.14,958 million in Fiscal 2020.

